    <preface>
      <p>Aged Care and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2014</p>
      <p>No. 126, 2014</p>
      <p>An Act to amend legislation relating to aged care, and for other purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments relating to aged care	3</p>
      <p>Aged Care Act 1997	3</p>
      <p>Aged Care (Transitional Provisions) Act 1997	4</p>
      <p>Schedule 2—Amendments relating to home care costs and compensation payments	6</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-1">Part 1</ref>—Amendments	6</p>
